@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@categoryId = 1
@materialId = 1
@csrf = PASTE_CURRENT_ADMIN_SESSION_TOKEN

### Sign in as ADMIN (auth-api.http), then get a NEW token after login.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/csrf

### All categories, including hidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/material-categories?page=0&size=20

### Create category (replace name to avoid duplicate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/material-categories
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Danh mục thử","description":"Nhóm dùng trong đồ án"}

### Replace info; update categoryId from the create response
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/material-categories/{{categoryId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"name":"Danh mục đã sửa","description":null}

### Hide category; true restores without changing individual material flags
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/material-categories/{{categoryId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"isActive":false}

### All materials including hidden category/stopped buying
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/materials?categoryId={{categoryId}}&page=0&size=20

### Create material (accepted defaults to true; hidden category means available=false)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/materials
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"categoryId":{{categoryId}},"name":"Vật liệu thử","grade":"Loại A","unit":"KG","description":null,"excludedItems":"Không nhận tạp chất","imageUrl":null}

### Replace info; materialId from create response. Omitted optional fields are cleared.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/materials/{{materialId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"categoryId":{{categoryId}},"name":"Vật liệu đã sửa","grade":"Loại A","unit":"KG"}

### Stop buying; true resumes (only publicly available if category active too)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/materials/{{materialId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrf}}

{"accepted":false}

### Admin detail includes accepted, categoryActive and available
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/materials/{{materialId}}

### Public price page excludes inactive/stopped material
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/prices/current?materialId={{materialId}}
